# Ignore file for the E2E aibom-scan image (e2e/docker/aibom-scan.Dockerfile). The build context is
# aibom/; BuildKit applies this "<Dockerfile name>.dockerignore" from the Dockerfile's directory.
#
# Allowlist: `pip install /src/aibom` (hatchling) needs only pyproject.toml, README.md (declared as
# the package readme), src/ and config/ (force-included into the wheel). Everything else stays out
# of the context: tests/ (including the 71 MB chroma fixture clone), bench/, examples/, state/,
# .venv/, uv.lock, caches and agent files.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!config/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
